<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">1BAKO 47.Soli Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">1 BAKOLINTO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kalata yakutanguna ya Paulo ku Bakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Bakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Bakolinto</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kalata yakutanguna ya Paulo ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bakolinto</para>
  <para style="imt">Busansulushi</para>
  <para style="ip">Kalata yakutanguna ku Bakolinto lyalalembwa ne mutumwa Paulo mu caka ca 55 AD, 1:1 Iyi ekalata yakutanguna pa makalata abili awo Paulo ngwalalembela mubungano waku Kolinto. Paulo walalemba iyi pa cindi ncalikuba ku Efenso, katana uyamba bulwendo bwakuya kufwakashila Bakolinto kupitila ku Makedoniya (16:5-9)</para>
  <para style="ip">Kalata iyi walailemba cebo ca makani abula kwelela alikwinshika mu mubungano wa ku Kolinto, awo ngwalanyumfwa ku bantu nabambi mu mubungano, makani akusalulana, ne makani abupombo bwalikwinshika mu mubungano. Uwu munshi unene wa Bakolinto walaya lulumbi cebo ca bwikalo bwa bufule bwalikubamo. Weco nkacela kuba cintu cishikukankamanisha mubungano uwu kucana mapensho alico. Kalata ya 1 Bakolinto likute kwamba pa malailile a lusuno (1:3)</para>
  <para style="iot">Mitwi ya makani</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulo lapanga mitende mubungano wa Bakolinto ne kulumba Lesa cebo cabo, 1:1-10 4:21</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulo lambanga makani ngwalanyumfwa akupansana mu mubungano wa Bakolinto.</para>
  <para style="io1">Cakonkapo, Paulo lambanga shabupombo, ne shakutwalana ku nkuta baklistu, 5-9</para>
  <para style="io1">Panyuma pakendi Paulo lapanga malailile pa makani abikwati, ne shabyakulya byakubenga ku tumbwanga, ne mwakupailila mukati mu mubungano, ne sha bipo bya Mushimu, kayi ne shakupunduka kubafu, 7:15</para>
  <para style="io1">Cakupwililisha Paulo lambanga mwakwinshila bintu cena, ne bintu bili mu moyo wakendi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Njame Paulo walakwiwa kuba mutumwa wa Klistu Yesu kwelana ne kuyanda kwa Lesa. Ndili pamo ne mukwetu Sositene.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tulalembelenga njamwe mubungano wa bantu bashoma Lesa bali mu Kolinto, Lesa walamusala kuba bakendi muli Yesu Klistu kayi, ne kuba baswepa pamo ne bantu bonse bali mumisena yonse, abo bonse balakunga pa Lina lya Mwami Yesu Klistu Mwami wabo nenjafwe eMwami wetu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kwina moyo ne lumuno lwa Lesa Ishetu ne Mwami Yesu Klistu bibe palinjamwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Colwe cili muli klistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Cindi conse ndalumbunga Lesa wakame cebo canjamwe pa kwina moyo kwakendi nshalamulesha muli Klistu Yesu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pacebo cakuba muli Klistu, Lesa lamuleleke mubintu byonse mbuli mung'ambilo ne lwinshibo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Makani alambanga sha Klistu alabonekele kuba ancine ncine mulinjamwe. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pacebo cilico, paliya cipo naba cimo ncemwabula pacino cindi mpomulapembelelenga kwisa kwa Mwami wetu Yesu Klistu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lesa nakamuyuminishe mpaka kumapwililisho kwambeti pabusuba bwakwisa Mwami wetu Yesu Klistu mukacanike babula kampenda. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lesa washomeka pakwinga endiye walamukuweti mube pamo mu Mwanendi Yesu Klistu Mwami wetu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kupansana mu mubungano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lino ndamusengenga mobanse mu Lina lya Mwami wetu Yesu Klistu kwambeti kamusuminishananga kapatabanga kupansana pakati penu, kamunyumfwananga cakupwililila, muyeyo umo, ne nshila imo yakwinshilamo bintu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pakwinga nabambi bansebendi Kuloyi balang'ambileti mulalondolonga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ncendambanga nici, uliyense palinjamwe lambanga shakendi, umbi lambangeti, “Ame ndakonkelenga Paulo.” Naumbi lambangeti, “Ame ndakonkelenga Apolo.” Naumbi lambangeti, “Ame ndakonkelenga Petulo.” “Kayi naumbi lambangeti, ame ndakonkelenga Klistu.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Sena Klistu layabaniki? Sena ni Paulo walapopwa pacebo cenu? Sena mwalabatishiwa mulina lya Paulo?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ndalumbunga Lesa kwambeti paliya naba umo mulinjamwe ngondalabatisha, ame ndalabatishowa Klispo ne Gayo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Neco paliya wela kwambeti walabatishiwa mu lina lyakame. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nabambi mbondanukako mbondalabatisha ni Stefano ne bakashendi ne banabendi, nkandanukunga kwambeti ndalabatishapo nabambi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pakwinga Klistu uliya kuntumapo kuya kubatisha, nsombi kuya kukambauka Mulumbe Waina. Nteko kukambauka kwakulipa maswi amano sobwe, pakwinga ndenseco, ngofu sha lufu lwa Klistu palusanda ngashiyeyelwa kuba shabulyo.</para>
  <para style="s">Klistu engofu ne mano a Lesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Makani alambanga sha lufu lwa Klistu palusanda nabulyo kulyabo balataikinga, nomba kulinjafwe tulimunshila yakupulushiwa ningofu sha Lesa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pakwinga Lesa mu Mabala akendi lambangeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ninkononge mano abantu balalibonongeti</para>
  <para style="q">bacenjela kwambeti buchenjeshi bwa bacenjela nkabutenshika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Inga lino bantu ba mano balalibikinga papeyo? Inga bantu baiya bintu bingi balibikinga papeyo? Inga bantu balatangalanga cebo cakuba nemano apacishi ca panshi nabo balikupeyo? Pakwinga Lesa latuleshe kwambeti mano abantu nabulyo!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mu mano a Lesa, bantu bapacishi capanshi calabalila kumwinshiba Lesa kupitila mu mano abo, pakwinga makani ngotulakambaukunga ngobalabononga bantu kuba abulyo, Lesa walakondweti apulushilemo abo bashoma muli endiye. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Bayuda balayandanga kubona bishikukankamanisha, kakuli balo Bagiliki balayandanga kubona bintu byamano. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nomba afwe tulakambaukunga Klistu walapopwa palusanda, makani awa kuli Bayuda nicisesemyo, kubantu bakunsa balo nabulyo. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nsombi Bayuda nambi bantu bakunsa abo mbwalakuwa Lesa, bacinshi cena kwambeti Klistu ningofu, kayi emano a Lesa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pakwinga ico cilabonekengeti buluya bwa Lesa, capita mano abantu. Kayi ico cilaboneshenga kuba cabula ngofu kuli Lesa, cikute ngofu kupita sha bantu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mobanse bame, kamuyeyani ncemwalikuba mpwalamukuwa Lesa, abo balikuboneka bamano kubantu, kayi bangofu nambi abo balasemwa kubantu balemekwa, nibang'ana pakati penu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Neco Lesa walasala bintu ibyo bantu mbyobakute kuyeyeti nibya buluya, kwambeti bipe nsoni bantu ba mano, ne kusala bintu byabula ngofu kwambeti bikape nsoni abo balabonekengeti bakute ngofu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kayi Lesa walasala bintu byabula kulemekwa nambi byabula mpuwo kwambeti abo bakute kuboneka balemekwa babe babulyo pacebo ca bintu byabo bya bula kumutwi. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Neco paliya muntu wela kulisumpula pamenso a Lesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lesa mwine ewalayanda kwambeti amwe mube pamo muli Klistu nendi abe mumano etu, walatutwala pamenso a Lesa mubululami, walatuswepesha ne kutusungulula. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Neco mbuli Mabala a Lesa ncalambangeti, “Uyo layandanga kulisumpula alisumpule kwelana ne ncalensa Mwami.”</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Paulo lakambaukunga makani a Klistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nomba ame mpondalesa kuli njamwe mobanse, nkandalasebensesha maswi abuya, pakumukambaukila maseseke a Mulumbe wa Lesa. Nkandalalibonesha kucenjela sobwe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pakwinga mpondalikuba nenjamwe ndiya kuyeyapo kumwambila cintu nacimbi sobwe, nsombi shalufu lwakendi Klistu lwapalusanda. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nkandalikuba nengofu pasa mpondalesa, neco ndalikantutuma cebo cabuyowa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mu maswi akame mpondalikukambauka ndiyakusebensesha maswi a kumunyengelela mano abuntu, nsombi ndalabonesha ngofu sha Mushimu Uswepa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ndalenseco kwambeti kamutashoma mano amuntu, nsombi ngofu sha lesa.</para>
  <para style="s">Mano a Lesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nomba tulambanga bintu bya mano kubantu bakute lushomo. Nikukabeco nkatulambanga mano amuntu, nambi mano abendeleshi bamucishi cino capanshi abo balipepi kupwa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nsombi mano a Lesa alikuba asolekwa engotulambanga, Lesa ngalabambilalimo katanabumba cishi kwambeti nenjafwe tukabe nebulemu bwa Lesa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pakati pa bendeleshi bamucishi capanshi paliya nabaumo walikwinshiba mano awa, pakwinga nebalikwayinshiba mpani nebalabula kumupopa palusanda Mwami Walemekwa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mbuli Mabala ncalambangeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ibyo muntu mbyatanabonapo</para>
  <para style="q">nambi kubinyumfwapo,</para>
  <para style="q">ibyo muntu mbyatanayeyapo kwambeti nibikenshike</para>
  <para style="q">Lesa embyalabambila bantu bamusuni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nomba kuli njafwe Lesa walabiyubulula kupitila mu Mushimu Uswepa, pakwinga Mushimu Uswepa winshi byonse nambi miyeyo ya Lesa yabushishi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Sena pali muntu wela kwinshiba ncalayeyenga munendi? Sobwe! Nsombi mushimu wakendi laciyeyenga. Neco paliya wela kwinshiba bintu bya Lesa nsombi Mushimu wa Lesa mwine. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nomba afwe tukute kwinshiba bipo mbyalatupa Lesa, pakwinga nkatukute kuyeya, nambi kwinshiba bintu mbuli ncobakute kwinshiba bantu balatambula mushimu wacishi capanshi. Nsombi Lesa ewalatupa Mushimu wakendi kwabulyo kwambeti utunyamfwilishenga kwinshiba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kayi nkatulakambaukunga maswi amano abuntu sobwe, nsombi maswi alafumunga kuli Mushimu Uswepa, tukute kusansulula bintu bya kumushimu kuli abo bakute Mushimu Uswepa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Muntu wabula Mushimu wa Lesa nkela kutambula bintu bya Mushimu wa Lesa. Pakwinga kulyendiye nibyabuluya, kayi nkela kubinshiba sobwe, pakwinga muntu welela kubinshiba pa kunyamfwiwa ne Mushimu Uswepa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Muntu ukute Mushimu Uswepa ngaucikonsha kwinshiba bwikalo bwaina ne bwaipa bwabintu byonse, kayi paliya wela kumubeteka. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mbuli Mabala a Lesa ncalambangeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Niyani wela kwinshiba</para>
  <para style="q">miyeyo ya Lesa</para>
  <para style="q">niyani wela kumwambila cakwinsa?” Nomba afwe tukute miyeyo ya Klistu.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Calaleta kupansana pakati pabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Cakubinga mobanse bame, ndiya kwamba nenjamwe mbuli bantu bakute Mushimu Uswepa, nsombi pakwamba nenjamwe, ndalikumuboneti bantu bakumubili, nambi batwanike muli Klistu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ndalamupa mukupa wakunwa, nteco cakulya cayuma yuma sobwe, pakwinga mwalikamutana mushika pacimo cakulya, nambi pacino cindi nkamuna mushika pacimo cakulya cayuma yuma. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pakwinga bwikalo bwenu bulyeti bwikalo bwabantu bamucishi capanshi, neco pakati penu pali munyono ne kutanyumfwana, sena ici nkacilaleshengeti bwikalo bwenu bucili bwikalo bwa bantu bapa cishi capanshi, kayi mucikonkela bwikalo bwa bantu bamucishi capanshi? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Amwe mukute kwambeti, “Mulakonkelenga Paulo,” Banenu bakute kwambeti, “Balakonkelenga Apolo,” Sena mwapusana ne bantu bulyo?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Inga Apolo niyani? Paulo niyani? Twense tobasebenshi ba Lesa balamubonesha nshila ya kushoma muli Yesu Klistu. Uliyense lasebensenga ncito Mwami njalamupa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ame ndalabyala mbuto isho nshaletilila menshi Apolo, nsombi Lesa ewalashikulisha. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mulabono kwambeti shikubyala ne shikwitilila menshi paliya ncobabelepo, nsombi Lesa eukute kushikulisha. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Neco paliya kupusana pakati pali shikubyala ne shikwitilila menshi, pakwinga Lesa nakape cilambo muntu uliyense kwelana nencito njalikwinsa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Afwe tobasebenshi ba Lesa, amwe njamwe libala lyakendi, kayi njamwe ng'anda ya Lesa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kupitila munkumbo nshalampa Lesa, ame pakuba shikwibaka wabuya ndalemba ne kubamba cena pakwibaka kwambeti naumbi muntu aibakepo, nsombi uliyense acenjele mwalebakilinga. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pakwinga paliya muntu wela kutala ne kwimba lulindi pambi, kushiya apo patalwa kendi, apo patalwa ni Yesu Klistu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Palulindi apo patalwa muntu ngawibakapo ne mabwe a golide nambi asilifa nambi mabwe abeka beka nambi bitondo nambi mwila nambi ne matete. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nomba pabusuba bwakwisa Klistu, incito sha muntu uliyense nishikabonekele, pabusuba ubo mulilo nukayubulule incito isho patuba tuu! Uwo mulilo nukelekeshe mushobo wa ncito shamuntu uliyense. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Na incito sha muntu shikabule kupya ne mulilo, uyo walebakapo nakapewe cilambo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lino na incito sha muntu shikapye ne mulilo okwambeti nendi nakataikilwe byonse, nomba kupuluka kwa muntuyu nikukabeti layokolwa mumulilo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Sena nkamucishi kwambeti njamwe ng'anda ya Lesa, kayi Mushimu wakendi ukute kwikala mulijamwe?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Neco na muntu wononga ng'anda, ya Lesa nendi Lesa, nakamononge muntuyo, pakwinga ng'anda ya Lesa yaswepa kayi ng'andeyo njamwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kamutalibepanga, napali muntu lalibonongeti ukute mano mubwikalo bwa pano pacishi capanshi, kabani muluya, kwambeti abe wamano ancine ncine. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kuli Lesa, mano apano pacishi capanshi nabulyo, pakwinga Mabala a Lesa alambangeti, “Lesa ukute kubekata bamano mubumaluku bwabo.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kayi Mabala alambangeti, “Mwami ucinsheti manjeyaulwa abantu bamano nabulyo.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Neco muntu katalitunta pacebo ca bantu banendi, pakwinga bintu byonse nibyenu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nambi Paulo nambi Apolo nambi Petulo nambi cishi capanshici ne buyumi nambi lufu nambi bintu bilipo lelo kayi ne bintu byeti bikese kuntangu byonse nibyenu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nomba nenjamwe mobakendi Klistu, nendi Klistu niwa Lesa.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Njafwe batumwa ba Klistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Neco, mobantu amwe kamutubonangeti basebenshi ba Klistu bapewa kwendelesha ne kukambauka makani amaseseke a Lesa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Cilayandikinga kuli bantu bapewa ncito iyi nikuba bashomeka ku Mwami wabo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nambi mung'ombolosha nambi komboloshewa kunkuta iliyonse yabantu, cakubinga nicakwambeti ndiya naco ncito, nkandela kulyombolosha ndemwine. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nkandayeyengeti pali ncondalepisha, nsombi nkandambangeti ndiya kampenda sobwe, nsombi Mwami Lesa mwine ambeteke. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Neco kamutombolosha muntu uliyense cindi celela nkacitana cishika. Kombolosha kwakumapwililisho kwela kwinshika Mwami akesa, neco lakayubululunga byonse byasolekwa mu mushinshe nekubika patuba miyeyo yabantu, Lesa nakalumbaishe muntu uliyense kwelana nencito shakendi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Neco mobanse ndambanga makani awa pali njame ne Apolo, ndambangeco pacebo cenu kwambeti mwiye kulinjafwe ncolapandululunga mwambo ulambangeti, “Konkani cena bintu byalembwa.” Ndayandanga kwambeti mucileke cinga cakulisumpula ne kusulana pakati penu cebo cakwambeti mobambi mulakonkelenga umo nekusampula naumbi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Niyani walamupa ngofu shakulisumpula? Nicani ncomukute ico ncemwabula kupewa ne Lesa? Na mwalensa kupewa, inga kulisumpula kwenu kulafumunga kupeyo?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mulekutu kendi? Sena mulaba babile kendi? Sena mulaba bami kendi, afwe katutana? Ee ndayandishishinga kwambeti mube bami, mpani ingatumantamo lubasu lwakombolosha pamo mu bwami. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ame ndacibonongeti Lesa walatubika kuba batumwa mwabula kwelela, tulyeti bantu basungwa balenga akufwa, tulasekwanga ne bonse mucishi, bangelo nebantu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Tulabanga bashilu cebo ca Klistu, nsombi amwe Klistu lamupa mano. Afwe tulabulu ngofu kayi tulapelwa, amwe mulaba nengofu nebulemu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mpaka lelo tulanyumfunga nsala, tuliya menshi akunwa, tulafwalangowa masankunya, tulomwanga, kayi tuliya pakwikala. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Tulasebensenga cangofu, kayi bantu batubepesha tukute kubasengela kuli Lesa kwambeti abaleleke, twacana mapensho tukute kwikalika cali. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Muntu atutukana tukute kumukumbula mwabulemu. Lelo tulabonekengeti ndala shapacishi capanshi nambi bintu mbyobasula bantu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nkandalembenga kwambeti ndimunyumfwishe nsoni sobwe, nsombi ndayandanga kumulesha cakwinsa, pakwinga mobana bame mbonsuni. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Inga kuba beshikwiyisha bangi bela bamwiyisha makani a Klistu, nsombi muliya bameshenu bangi, ame ndalabeti Ishenu mubwikalo bwenu muli Klistu, cebo cakwambeti ndalamukambaukila makani a Klistu Yesu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Neco ndasengenga kwambeti mukonkele ncondenshinga. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi ncendalatumina Timoti kuli njamwe mwaname mubwikalo bwa ciklistu ngonsuni washoma Lesa, nakese akamwanushe shabwikalo bwakame muli Klistu bwelana ne nconkute kwiyisha mumibungano yonse ya bantu ba Lesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nabambi balatatiki kulisumpula eti ame nteti nkeseko uko. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nsombi na Mwami ansumunishe ndesanga uko linolino, neco ndakesoko, ninkepushe sha makani ngobalambanga, kayi nengofu isho nshobalasebenseshenga abo balalisumpulunga. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pakwinga Bwami bwa Lesa nkabulipo mumaswi onkowa sobwe, nsombi mumicito yangofu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lino nicani ncemulayandanga? Sena nkese ne musako nambi nkese ne lusuno ne moyo wakulicepesha?</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Bupombo mumubungano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Cakubinga kulambwangeti pali bupombo buyosha bulenshikinga pakati penu, nambi bakunsa nkabana bacinsapo. Ndanyumfu kwambeti mutuloba naumbi lononga ne banyina bakucanamo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nomba amwe mulatwanganga! Sobwe mwela kungumana, nekumufunya pakati penu muntu wenseco. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nikukabeti ame nkandiko uko, nsombi moyo wakame uli kendi nenjamwe nditu, pacakame ndamombolosho kendi muntu uyo walenseco eti nkondi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Neco mwakabungana pamo mu lina lya Mwami Yesu, moyo wakame nukabenga nenjamwe, kayi nengofu sha Mwami wetu Yesu nishikabengaponga. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Muyabeni muntuyo kungofu sha Satana kwambeti mubili wakendi wonongeke, nsombi mushimu wakendi ukese ukapuluke pabusuba bwa Mwami.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Neco kutwanga kwenu nkakwaina, mwishi cena maswi alambangeti, “Tushikufutumusha tung'ana mwatubika mubunga bwakandilwa ne menshi bukute kufutumuka bonse.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Funyani cishikufutumusha cakaindi kwambeti mube baswepa cakupwililila. Kayi nimukabeti bunga bwakandilwa ne menshi abula cishikufutumusha, cakubinga ndicisheti ncomubele. Pakwinga Klistu Mwana mbelele, Pasika wetu walabengwa mulumbo pacebo cetu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi nkatwela kusekelelela Pasika wetu ne shinkwa ukute cishikufutumusha cakaindi, cishikufutumusha cabwipishi nekwipa moyo. Anu katusekelelani Pasika ne shinkwa wabula cishikufutumusha, nemoyo waloma kayi wancine ncine.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mukalata njondalamulembela ndalamwambileti kutekala pamo ne bantu bapombo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nkandambangeti kamutakumananga nabo bantu bamucishi, nambi bapombo nambi bakuma nambi bakabwalala nambi bakute kukambilila tumbwanga sobwe, pakwinga na kacilico amwe ngamwinsa kufumamo mucishi capanshi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nomba lino ndamulembelenga kwambeti kamutekalanga ne muntu ukute kulibandeti ni muklistu kakuli ni mupombo nambi mukuma nambi ukute kukambilila tumbwanga nambi utekata mulomo nambi cakolwa kayi nambi kabwalala, muntu ulico nkamwela nekulya nendi pamo sobwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nteyo ncito yakame kombolosha bantu babula lushomo, neco sena ntebo bali mumubungano wa bantu ba Lesa mbomwelela kombolosha? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Abo balikunsa Lesa nakabomboloshe,mbuli Mabala a Lesa ncalambangeti “Kamumufunyani muntu waipa pakati penu.”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Makani a milandu pakati pa Baklistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Na umo pakati palinjamwe ukute mulandu ne muklistu munendi, nicani kutwalana kunkuta yabantu bakunsa? Inga kutakuwa bantu ba Lesa kwambeti bese bapwishe makani awo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Sena nkamucishi kwambeti baklistu endibo beti bakomboloshe bantu bonse? Nomba lino na amwe nimukomboloshe bantu bonse, sena nkamwela kucikonsha kombolosha milandu ing'ana ing'ana ilico? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Sena nkamucishi kwambeti nitukomboloshe bangelo? Inga kulyeconi ne bintu byabuyumi bwa pano pacishi capanshi? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Neco, nakamuli mwakobana mumakani alico, sena ngamwatwala kubomboloshi bakute kunyanshiwa nemubungano wabantu ba Lesa kwambeti benga bamomboloshe? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ndambilinga nsulo kwambeti ndimunyufwishe nsoni, sena pakati penu paliya ukute mano uyo welela kombolosha baklistu banendi? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nipacebo cini muklistu lapanga mulandu muklistu munendi nekutwalana kunkuta, caipapo kayi, mulatwalananga ku nkuta yabantu bakunsa kuya kombolola? <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pakupana milandu palwenu mobene cilaleshenga kwambeti mulalilwa kendi nditu. Sena nkamwela kwipishilwa? Sena nkamwela kwibilwa? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomba amwe mulepishilinga bantu ne kubebila, nsombi caipishishapo kayi, mulebilinga ne baklistu banenu! <verse number="9" style="v"/>Sena nkamucishi kwambeti babula kululama nteti bakatambule Bwami bwa Lesa? Kamutabepwa nebantu bafule nambi beshikukambilila tumbwanga nambi bapombo nambi bakute lunkumbwa lwakona ciliconse <verse number="10" style="v"/>nambi bakabwalala nambi bakuma nambi bacakolwa nambi batungushi kayi nambi bakapondo. Paliya umo wa bantu aba eshi akatambule Bwami bwa Lesa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nabambi mulinjamwe encomwalikuba, nsombi lino mwalaswepeshewa, mwalasanduka kuba bantu ba Lesa, mwalaba balulama pamenso pa Lesa kupitila mu Lina lya Mwami Yesu Klistu, kayi ne mu Mushimu wa Lesa wetu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mibili Yenu Niya Lesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ame nganjinsa bintu bingi, nsombi ntebyo byonse byela kunyamfwilisha sobwe. Byonse ngandibinsa, nomba nteti nkabe musha kulibyo sobwe. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Cakulya nicishikwingila mulibunda, nalyo libunda nilishikutambula cakulya. Nsombi Lesa nakabipwishe byonse bibili. Mubili wamuntu ntewo wakutwala kubupombo, pakwinga emubili wa Mwami, kayi endiye mwine mubili. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pakwinga Lesa walamupundusha kubafu Mwami Yesu, nenjafwe nakatupundushe kubafu mungofu shakendi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mucishi cena kwambeti mibili yenu nibilama bya mubili wa Klistu, neco sena ngamanta cilama camubili wa Klistu nekuya kupamankanya pamo ne mubili wa mutukashi mufule? Nkacela kwinshika! <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mpani nkamucishi kwambeti mutuloba lapamankanyanga mubili wakendi kumutukashi mufule bakute kuba mubili umo. Mabala a Lesa alambanga mwakutasoleka kwambeti<note caller="+" style="f">Matatikilo 2:2</note> “Babili nibakabe mubili umo.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nomba uyo nendi lapamankananga ne Mwami ukute kuba pamo nendi mu mushimu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Bulekeni bupombo. Bwipishi bonse muntu mbwakute kwinsa nkabukute kukumya mubili wakendi, nsombi mufule ukute kusamfwanya mubili wakendi mwine. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Sena nkamucishi kwambeti mubili wenu eng'anda ya Mushimu Uswepa uwo ukute kwikala mulinjamwe ngomwalapewa ne Lesa? Ecebo cakendi nkamulipo pacenu mwenka moba Lesa, <verse number="20" style="v"/>uyo walamula ne mulo wapelu, neco sebenseshani mibili yenu mwabulemu.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Makani a cikwati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lino ndakumbulunga makani ngomwalanjipusha mukalata yenu. Ee, caina mutuloba kubula kweba. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nomba pacebo cakufula kwabupombo, anu mutuloba uliyense abe ne mukashendi enka, nendi mutukashi abe nemulume wakendi enka. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mutuloba akwanilishe ncito njabela mutuloba mung'anda, nendi mutukashi akwanilishe ncito njabela mutukashi mung'anda. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mukashi liya ngofu pamubili wakendi sobwe, nsombi mulume eukute ngofu. Nendi mulume liya ngofu pamubili wakendi sobwe, nsombi mukashendi eukute ngofu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kamutakanishanga mibili yenu mung'anda. Ee ngacibeco namunyumfwana kwinseco kwa kacindi kang'ana, kwambeti mushe mano kukupaila. Panyuma pakendi ingamupitilisha kuyabilana mibili kwambeti Satana katamwelekeshani pacebo cakutekata myoyo kwenu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ncendambanga nikumusuminishowa, nteko kumutinga panshingo sobwe. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ninganyanda kwambeti bantu bonse nshinga nibalyeti njame, nomba Lesa walapa muntu uliyense cipo cakendi, naumbi cipo camushobo uyu, kayi naumbi cipo camushobo usa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lino kuli babula kweba ne bamukalubingi, ndambanga ndeti bapitilishe kwikala bonka mbuli ame ncondekalanga. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nomba nankabela kucikonsha kulukanisha lunkumbwa lwabo, anu kabebani pakwinga caina kweba kupita kupenga nelunkumbwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kuli bantu bebana, mulawo ngondamupanga wabula kuba wakame nsombi ulafumunga ku Mwami nuwu, mukashi kataleka mulume. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Na umuleka mulume, kekalani mushike mpani ngaubweshana nemulume. Neye mulume kataleka mukashendi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kuli nabambi nteye Mwami lambanga nsombi njame. Muklistu weba mukashi wakunsa, nomba namukashi usumina kupitilisha kwikala nemulume, mulume katamuleka mukashendi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Cimocimo mukashi muklistu webwa kumulume wakunsa, nomba uyo mulume usumina kupitilisha kwikala ne mukashendi, mukashi katamuleka mulume. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pakwinga mulume wakunsa ukute kuba waswepa kuli Lesa cebo ca mukashendi Muklistu. Nendi mukashi wakunsa ukute kuba waswepa cebo camulume Muklistu. Necalabula kubeco, nshinga bana benu nebabula kuba baswepa, nomba lino mbuli ncocibele, bana benu bakute kuba baswepa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nomba nawakunsa layanda kuleka muklistu, amuleke. Palico muklistu mutuloba nambi mutukashi wasunguluka. Lesa walamukuwa kwambeti mwikale ne buyumi bwa lumuno. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Obe mukashi muklistu ucinshi econi kwambeti nukamupulushe mulume? Nenjobe mulume muklistu ucinshi econi kwambeti nukamupulushe mukashobe?</para>
  <para style="s">Ikalani mubwikalo mbwalamupa Lesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nikukabeco lekani uliyense ekale mubwikalo mbwalapewa ne Mwami Yesu, mbuli ncomwalikuba Lesa mpwalamukuwa. Iyi emilawo njonkute kwiyisha mumibungano yonse. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Namuntu lakwiwa ne Lesa kaliwapalulwa kendi, katasoleka kubeti nkapalulwa. Nicimocimo namuntu nkali kuba wapalulwa pacindi Lesa mpwalamukuwa katapalulwa sobwe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nambi muntu wapalulwa nambi wabula kupalulwa paliya cilipo sobwe. Nsombi cilayandikinga ni kunyumfwila Milawo ya Lesa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Muntu uliyense apitilishe kwikala mbuli ncalikuba cindi ncalakwiwa ne Lesa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Sena mwalikuba basha cindi ncalamukuwa Lesa? Kamutapenga! Nomba na mukuteko colwe ca kusunguluka sebenseshani colwe cilico. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pakwinga muntu walikuba musha cindi Mwami ncalamukuwa, muntuyo kuli Mwami wasunguluka. Cimocimo uyo walikuba wasunguluka cindi Mwami ncalamukuwa nimusha wakendi Klistu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lesa walamuula ne mulo wapelu, neco kamutabanga basha babantu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mobanse uliyense apitilishe kwikala pamenso pa Lesa kwelana mbuli ncalikuba cindi ncalamukuwa Lesa.</para>
  <para style="s">Bankungulume ne bamukalubingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lino kwamba pa makani abatana beba ne kwebwa ngomwalalemba, ndiya mulawo wa Mwami sobwe. Nsombi ndamwambilinga kwelana ne kuyeya kwakame pakuba muntu washomeka muluse lwa Mwami.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Pakuyeya shamakatasho alipepi kwinshika, ndayeyengeti caina muntu apitilishe kwikala mbuli ncabele. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Sena ukute mukashi? Kotelekesha kumuleka. Sena njobe nkungulume? Kotelekesha kweba. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nomba na uyanda kweba paliya kwipisha kulipo sobwe. Kayi namulindu uyanda kwebwa neye paliya kwipisha kulipo sobwe. Nomba bantu bali mucikwati nibakacane mapensho mubuyumi bwabo, neco ndayandangeti kamutakacana mapensho alico.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ncondamwambilinga mobanse nicakwambeti, cindi cilashala nicifupi. Neco kufuma cindi cino batuloba bali mucikwati babeti nkabeba, <verse number="30" style="v"/>kayi abo balalilinga babeti nkabalalilinga, kayi abo balakondwanga babeti nkabalakondwanga, kayi abo balaulunga bintu bekaleti baliya bintu mbyobalaula, <verse number="31" style="v"/>abo balasebenseshenga bintu byapacishi pano, kabatabika myoyo yabo mubintu ibyo. Pakwinga cishi cino capanshi mbuli ncocilabonekenga nteti cikale cindi citali sobwe. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lino ndayandishishinga kwambeti mube basunguluka kubishi kuyakamwisha. Nkungulume ukute kusha mano kubintu bya Mwami, pakwinga lelekeshenga kumukondwelesha Mwami. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nomba mutuloba ukute mukashi ukute kusha mano kubintu byapacishi capanshi pano kuyeya cakumwinshila mukashendi kwambeti abe wakondwa. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Neco ukute kaliwekata pabili. Kayi nendi mutukashi wabula kwebwa nambi mulindu nendi ukute kaliwasha mano kubintu bya Mwami, pakwinga ukute kuyanda kulibenga kumubili ne kumushimu. Nomba mukashi webwa ukute kusha mano kubintu bya pano pacishi kuyeya ncelela kumwinshila mulume kwambeti abenga wakondwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ndambangeco kuyanda kumunyamfwa, nteko kumucalila byakwinsa sobwe. Ncondayandanga nikwambeti mwinsenga bintu byonse mwalumbuluka, kwambeti mulibengenga cakupwililila pakusebensela Mwami.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Na naumbi uyeyeti nkalenshinga cintu caina pakukanisha mwanendi mulindu kwebwa kumutuloba wa mumamikila, kayi uboneti mwanendi lapiti pamushimba wakwebwa, mulekeni ense ncalayeyenga, liya kwipisha sobwe, ngabebana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nomba na mutuloba uyeya mwine kwakubula kumukakatisha, kayi na miyeyo yakendi ifuma panshi pamoyo wakendi kwambeti nkasuni kumweba mulinduyu, kayi na ngacikonsha kwikata moyo wakendi, muntuyu neye lenshi cena. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Neco mutuloba lebe mulindu ngwalikuba wamamikila lenshi cena, nomba neye utasuni kweba lenshi cena kupitapo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mukashi wasungwa ku mulawo wacikwati mulume acibanga muyumi. Na mulume uluma bulongo, mukashi wasunguluka kwebwa ku mutuloba uliyense lamukondo, nomba uyo mutuloba wela kuba muklistu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kuyeya kwakame nikwambeti ngawikala cena kupitapo naubula kwebwa. Ndayeyenga kwambeti nenjame nkute Mushimu wa Lesa.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Byakulya bishikubengwa kutumbwanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lino, ndambanga ncemwalalemba pa byakulya bishikubengwa kutumbwanga. Nicakubinga kwambeti twense tukute mano nomba mano akute kutwangisha bantu. Nsombi lusuno lonka elukute kwibaka. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Muntu lalibonongeti ukute lwishibo, usa muntu nkana uba ne lwishibo lwakwinshiba bintu mbuli mwelela kubinshibala. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nomba muntu usuni Lesa ukute kwishibikwa ne Lesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lino ng'ambe makani a byakulya bishikubengwa kutumbwanga. Tucishi kwambeti tumbwanga tulemanininga cintu cabulapo, tucishi kwambeti kuli Lesa umowa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nabambi bakute kwambeti kwilu nambi panshi pano, pali bintu mbyobakute kukuweti balesa. Ee pali balesa bangi nebami bangi, <verse number="6" style="v"/>nomba kuli njafwe kuli Lesa umowa, Bata, abo balalenga bintu byonse kayi engotwekalila. Kayi kuli njafwe kuli Mwami umowa Yesu klistu, uyo ngwalasebensesha Lesa pakulenga bintu byonse kufumina mulyendiye afwe tukute buyumi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nomba ntebo bonse bacishi cancine ncine ici. Nabambi baleshibila kukambilila tumbwanga, mpaka lelo aba bantu balyanga byakulya bishikubengwa kutumbwanga, bakute kabacinshi kwambeti byabengwa kutumbwanga. Cebo cakubula lwinshibo lwa kupansanya caipa ne caina bakute kuyeyeti byakulya bilabasofwanya. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nicancinencine, cakulya nkacela kututwala pepi ne Lesa, nambi tulya, kayi nambi tubula kulya byakulya nabimbi paliya cilipo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nomba cenjelani kusunguluka kwenu pakwinsa bintu, pakwinga ngaciba ceshikupesha bantu kwipisha kuli abo bakute lwinshibo lung'ana. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Twambeti muntu ukute lwinshibo lung'ana, ukubona obe okute lwishibo kolyela mung'anda yakukambililamo tumbwanga, sena ici nteti akacibone kuba caina kwambeti neye alye cakulya cishikubengwa kutumbwanga? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Neco uyo ukute lwinshibo lung'ana mwanse wakobe ngwalafwila klistu nukapesheti akataike cebo ca njobe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Neco mulepishilinga Yesu Klistu pacindi mpomulepishilinga baklistu banenu abo bakute lwinshibo lung'ana lwakwinshiba caina ne caipa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi nacakulya ciba nsuntu kumuklistu muname nteti nkalyepo nyama tubili kayi.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Incito ya mutumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Sena ntame muntu wasunguluka? Sena ntame mutumwa? Sena ndiya kumubona Mwami wetu Yesu? Sena ntamwe bisepo byancito yakame ya kusebensela Mwami? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nikukabeti nabambi nkabalanjeyelengeti ndemutumwa, kuli njamwe ndemutumwa nditu, pakwinga kuba baklistu kwenu nibukamboni bwa kwambeti njame mutumwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ecisa ncekute kubakumbula bantu bakute kuyanda kumpita panshi kumano. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Sena nkandelela kupewa cakulya ne cakunwa? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nambi sena, nkatwelela kumanta bamakashetu pamo nenjafwe twayanga pa bulwendo mbuli batumwa nabambi kayi ne bakwabo Mwami Yesu ne Petulo ncebakute kwinsa? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nambi sena, ame ne Banabasi njafwe twenka otwelela kulisebensela kwambeti tucane mbyotwabula mubuyumi bwetu? <verse number="7" style="v"/>Sena, pali mushilikali ukute kulifolesha mwine? Sena, pali mulimi wela kubyala cishango ncela kubula kulyako bisepo, nomba kataliko bisepo? Sena, pali muntu utanuko mandili kung'ombe nshasuwa?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nkandambangowa kufumina mungofu sha buntu sobwe, sena Milawo ya Lesa njalapa Mose nkailambanga cimocimo? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Tukute kubelenga mu Milawo ya Mose ilambangeti, “Kotamusunga matomo kumulomo musune lalyataulunga pamulunda wamasanse amaila.” Sena Mose mpwalambeco walikwambowa makani akusamalila ng'ombe shonka? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Sena nkalikubikapo nenjafwe? Cakubinga walalembela afwe, pakwinga mulimi neweshikulupula maila, bonse bela kupembeleleti bakayabaneko pabishango. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Afwe otwalabyala bintu byaina bya kumushimu pakati penu, sena caipa kumwambileti mwelela kutunyamfwa bintu mubuyumi bwetu bishikufuma kulinjamwe? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Na bantu nabambi belela kutambula bintu bya mushoboyo kufuma kulinjamwe, inga afwe sena nkatwelela kubapita pakutambula bintu?</para>
  <para style="p">Nomba tuliya kusebensesha ngofu isho. Nikukabeco, twalapita mu makatasho onse kwambeti katutabika nsuntu munshila yabantu kutatambula Mulumbe Waina ulambanga makani a Klistu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Sena, nkamucinshi kwambeti balasebenselenga mu Ng'anda ya Lesa bakute kulyako byakulya bya mu Ng'anda ya Lesa? Kayi abo bakute kutwala panteme pakubengela milumbo, sena naboyo nkabakute kumantako lubasu pa milumbo? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kwelana neco, Mwami walabika mulawo kwambeti abo balakambaukunga Mulumbe Waina bela kutambulako bintu bilayandikinga pabuyumi bwabo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nomba ame ndiya kusebensesha ishi ngofu. Kayi nkandalembenga kwambeti ndishisebenseshe sobwe. Caina kwambeti mfwa kupita muntu naumbi kundamuna cintu ncondatwangilingaponga. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Na ndakambaukunga Mulumbe Waina nkandela kulisumpula sobwe, pakwinga Mwami ewalampa mulawo wakukambauka. Nomba ngaba malele kulinjame nambula kukambauka Mulumbe Waina. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Na ndasebensenga mwakuyandishisha ninkatambule cilambo. Nomba na ndasebensenga cakutayanda okwambeti endenshingowa ncito njalampa Lesa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Inga cilambo cakame nicani? Cilambo cakame nicakwambeti ndakambaukanga Mulumbe Waina kankambaukanga kwabulyo mwakutalipilisha, nikukabeti ndalikuba ndelelela kutambula kantu pakukambauka Mulumbe Waina.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pakwinga ndasunguluka, ntame musha wamuntu uliyense sobwe, nsombi ndalalibika kuba musha wabantu bonse kwambeti nsandule bantu bangi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mpondalikuba ne Bayuda ndalikwikaleti Muyuda kwambeti ndibasandule. Nsombi nikukabeti ame ntame shikukonka Milawo Lesa njalapa Mose, ndalikwikaleti beshikukonka Milawo, kwambeti ndibasandule. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Cimocimo, pakuba ne bantu bakunsa ndalikubeti muntu wakunsa utaishi Milawo Lesa njalapa Mose kwambeti ndibasandule. Uku nteko kwambeti nkankute kunyumfwila milawo ya Lesa sobwe. Nsombi ndanyumfwilinga milawo ya Klistu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kuli bantu balushomo lwabula kuyuma, ndalikubeti muntu ukute lushomo lwabula kuyuma, kwambeti ndibasandule. Ku bantu bonse ndalikwikala mbuli ncobabele kwambeti nakacikonsheka mpulushepo nabambi munshila iliyonse. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Byonsebi ndabinshinga cebo ca Mulumbe Waina kwambeti nkamanteko lubasu mu colwe ca Mulumbe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Sena nkamucishi kwambeti pakute kuba bantu bangi bakute kupikishana kufwamba lubilo, nsombi umowa eukute kutambula cilambo? Nenjamwe munshila ilico, kamufwambani kwambeti mukatambule cilambo. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Uliyense lafwambanga lubilo lwa kupikishana alikanishe mubintu byonse, kwambeti akafwalikwe munshini wamaluba ukute kunyana papita kacindi kang'ana. Nomba afwe cilambo ncotitukatambule nteticikapwe sobwe. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi ndafwambanga cakulanga kuntangu. Ndakoshana ne muntu wishicena kuwala makofi, nkankute kuwala makofi mulukupwe. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nkute kupensha mubili wakame ne kuukoma kwambeti, ame ndalakambauka kubantu nabambi kantakacanika kubamuntu wabula kwelela kumantamo lubasu.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Baislayeli nicitondesho kulibashoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mobanse bame ndayandanga kwambeti mwanuke bintu byalenshikila bamashali betu bakulukulu abo balikukonkela Mose. Bonse balatampuka lwenje lufubela kabali batanguninwa ne likumbi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Bonse balabatishiwa mulikumbi ne mulwenje kulesheti balikukonkela Mose, <verse number="3" style="v"/>bonse balalya cakulya ca ku mushimu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kayi bonse balanwa cakunwa cakumushimu cimo, mulibwe lya candanshi lyakumushimu ilyo lyalikuya nabo pamo. Ilyo libwe lyacandanshi ni Klistu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nikukabeco Lesa nkalikuba wakondwa nebantu nabambi pakati pabo ecebo cakendi balafwa kayi bitumbi byabo byalikuba mbwee mucinyika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Byonsebi byalikuba bitondesho bishikutucenjesha afwe, kwambeti katutabanga ne lunkumbwa lwaipa mbuli ndobalikukute. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Katutakambililanga tumbwanga mbuli ncobalikwinsa nabambi. Mbuli ncecalembwa mu mabala, “Bantu balekala panshi kulya ne kunwa, balemana ne kushana kwasunsa bukome.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Katutensanga bupombo mbuli nabambi ncobalikwinsa, ico calashinisha bantu bakwana bina makumi abili ne bitatu pabusuba bumo cebo cabupombo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Katutamukalalishanga Klistu mbuli ncobalensa nabambi abo balalumwa njoka ne kufwa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Katutabanga bantu beshikutongauka mbuli ncobalikuba nabambi abo mbwalashina mungelo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Byonsebi byalenshikila bamashali betu kwambeti bibe bitondesho kuli nabambi. Byalalembwa kwambeti nenjafwe tucanepo lwiyo. Pakwinga tulipepi kucindi cakumapwlilisho acishi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Uyo layeyengeti washimpa mulushomo, asheko mano kwambeti katawa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Misunko njomulakumananga nayo nkayashiyanapo ne misunko njobalakumanapo nayo bantu nabambi. Nsombi Lesa washomeka, nteti akasuminishe kwambeti musunkwe kupitilila pangofu shenu. Neco mwakasunkwanga Lesa nakamupe ngofu ne kumubambila nshila yakupulukilamo.</para>
  <para style="s">Labacenjeshenga shakukambilila tumbwanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mobanse bame mwasunika, kamutantamukani kukukambilila tumbwanga. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ndambanga kulinjamweti bantu bakute mano. Mulyomboloshe mobene pabintu ibi mbyondamba. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Sena, twanwanga nkomeshi yakulumbaisha pamulalilo wa Mwami, nkatukute kuyabana milopa ya Klistu? Kayi twakomaunanga shinkwa ne kulya, sena nkatukute kuyabana mubili wa Klistu?. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pali shinkwa umo, afwe twense nambi tobangi, tuli mubili umo. Pakwinga twense tukute kuyabana mushinkwa umo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kamubonani ncobakute kwinsa Bayuda, abo bakute kulyako bintu bikute kubengwa milumbo, abo bakute kulyako milumbo, sena nkabakute kumantako lubasu pancito yapanteme pakubengela milumbo? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Sena apa ndapandululunga cani? Sena ndambangeti milumbo ikute kubengwa kutumbwanga ikute ncito? Nambi sena ndambangeti kambwanga kakute ncito? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Sobwe! Ncondambanga nici, iyo milumbo njobakute kubenga bantu bakunsa ikute kutambulwa nemishimu yaipa, nteko kuli Lesa sobwe. Neco nkansuni kwambeti mwikatanenga ne mishimu yaipa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nkamwela kucikonsha kunwina munkomeshi ya Mwami, uku kayi kamunwina mu nkomeshi ya mishimu yaipa. Nkamwela kucikonsha kulyela pa tebulu lya Mwami, uku kayi kamulyela patebulu lyamishimu yaipa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Sena tulayandanga kwambeti Lesa abe ne bufuba? Sena mulayeyengeti tukute ngofu kumupita Lesa?</para>
  <para style="s">Belela kulemekesha Lesa mubintu byonse mbyobalenshinga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nikukabeti twasuminishiwa kwinsa bintu byonse, nomba nteko kwambeti byonse byaina. Twasuminishiwa kwinsa bintu byonse, nomba nteko kwambeti byonse bikute kunyamfwa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Muntu kataliyandilanga enka bintu byaina, nsombi ayandileko banendi bintu byaina.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mwasunguluka kulya nyama iliyonse njobalolishinga pamusena wa makwebo kwakubula kwipusha mipusho yakumya kulushomo ndomukute. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Pakwinga Mabala a Lesa alambangeti, “Cishi capanshi nebintu byonse bilimo nibya Lesa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Na muntu wakunsa umukuwa kuya kulya cakulya, amwe mwasumina kuya, kamuya mulye ciliconse nceti enga amupe. Kamutaya mwipushe mipusho yakumya kulushomo ndomukute. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nsombi namwine umwambileti, “Nyama iyi yanga yabengwa kutumbwanga,” Nyama ilico kamutailya sobwe, pakwinga lamwambili mwine. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nteko kwambeti njamwe mwelela kupenga mumoyo sobwe, nsombi uyo lakwambili.</para>
  <para style="p">Naumbi ngawipusheti, “Nipacebo cini kusunguluka kwakame ngakufwekelelwa nemuntu lapengenga mwine mu moyo? <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nandalumbunga Lesa pacakulya, muntu ngaunyanshila cani pacakulya ncondatambulunga mwakulumba Lesa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Neco, nambi mulalinga nambi mulanunga nambi mulenshinga ciliconse kacibani cishikulemekesha Lesa. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Bwikalo bwenu bube bwaina butalete nsuntu ku Bayuda, nambi kubantu bakunsa, kayi ne kumubungano wa bantu ba Lesa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kamwinsanga mbuli ncondenshinga. Nkute kwelekesha kukondwelesha bantu pabintu byonse. Nkankute kuyanda bintu byonka byaina kwakame sobwe, nsombi nkute kuyanda bintu byaina ku bantu bonse kwambeti bakapuluke.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lino konkelani, ame mbuli nenjame ncondakonkelenga Klistu.</para>
  <para style="s">Bulemu bwabatukashi pakupaila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ndamulumbunga pakwinga mulanganukunga mubintu byonse, kayi mulakonkelenga biyisho mbyondalamushiyila. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nomba ndayandanga kwambeti mwishibeti Klistu endiye mutwi wa mutuloba uliyense. Neye mutuloba endiye mutwi wa mutukashi, neye Lesa endiye mutwi wa Klistu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Na mutuloba pa kupaila nambi pa kushinshima kaliwalifweka kumutwi ukute kunyansha mutwi wakendi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Neye mutukashi pakupaila nambi pa kushinshima kali wabula kulifweka kumutwi ukute kunyansha mutwi wakendi. Uliya kupusana ne mutukashi ngobalacese munkunyu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Na mutukashi ubula kulifweka kumutwi, cilicena kucesa mishishi yakendi. Pakwinga nicansoni mutukashi kucesa munkunyu nambi kucesa mishishi, neco, wela kulifweka kumutwi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mutuloba nkalayandikinga kulifweka kumutwi pakwinga ukute kulesha cimo ne bulemu bwa Lesa. Kakuli mutukashi neye ebulemu bwa mutuloba. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pakwinga mutuloba uliya kupangwa kufuma kumutukashi, nsombi mutukashi endiye walapangwa kufuma kumutuloba. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kayi mutuloba uliya kulengwa cebo ca mutukashi sobwe, nsombi mutukashi endiye walalengwa cebo camutuloba. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Neco, cebo ca bintu ibi ne cebo cabangelo, mutukashi alifweke kumutwi kwambeti cibe cilesho ca bulemu mbwakute. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mubuyumi bwetu muli Lesa, mutukashi nkela kubako kwabula mutuloba nambi mutuloba kubako kwakubula mutukashi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mbuli mutukashi ncalapangwa kufuma kumutuloba, neye mutuloba ukute kusemwa kufuma kumutukashi. Ibi byonse byalafuma kuli Lesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lino, kamulyomboloshani mobene na ngaciboneka cena kwambeti mutukashi apailenga kuli Lesa nkali wabula kulifweka kumutwi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Sena, bwikalo bwa buntu bwetu nkabukute kutwiyisheti cikute kupa nsoni mutuloba akutenga mishishi itali? <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nsombi kumutukashi neye ebulemu Lesa mbwalapa mutukashi mishishi itali itali kwambeti imufwekenga kumutwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Na pali muntu layandanga kutoteka pamakani awa, afwe nambi mibungano ya Lesa tuliya mwambo naumbi wampaililo wapita uwu sobwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Makani a cakulya ca mansailo ca Mwami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Mateyo 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Maliko 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lino, ncondayandanga kumulailila nteti mukondwe naco. Pakwinga mibungano yenu ilabanga yaipa kayi nkayaina. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Cakutanguna ndanyumfungeti mwabungananga pamo mumubungano mulasalulananga. Ndashoma kwambeti mpani makani awa nakubinga. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nkandatonshanyanga sobwe, pela kuba kupusana miyeyo pakati penu kwambeti abo balenshinga calulama baboneke. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Neco mukute mwabungananga pamo nkamukute kulya cakulya ca mansailo ca Mwami sobwe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pakwinga mukute kulya kwakusalana cakwinseti nabambi bakute bashala babula cakulya, kakuli nabambi bakute kwinsa kukolewa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Sena muliya manda enu uko nkomwelela kulyela nekunwinina? Sena mulayandangowa kupesha nsoni mubungano wa Lesa, nekunyalisha abo bantu balabulunga cakulya? Mulayandanga ng'ambeconi? Ndimulumbe sena? Pa bintu ibi nkandelela kumulumba sobwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ciyisho ncondalatambula ku Mwami encondalamupa kwambeti busuba busa mansailo, Mwami Yesu mpwalayabwa walamanta shinkwa, <verse number="24" style="v"/>mpwalalumbaisha Lesa ne kukomona walambeti “Uwu emubili wakame ngondabengele njamwe. Kamwinsanga ici kuba cakunganukilapo.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kayi copeleco mpobalapwisha kulya walamanta nkomeshi ya waini nekwambeti “Nkomeshi iyi ecipangano ca linolino cilapangwa nemilopa yakame. Cibe cakunganukilapo cindi conse mwanwanga.” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Pakwinga cindi conse mwalyanga shinkwa nekunwina munkomeshi iyi, mukute kukambauka shalufu lwa Mwami mpaka cindi nceti akese.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi na muntu uliyense ulya shinkwa uwu nekunwina munkomeshi ya Mwami munshila yabula kwelela, lepishilinga mubili nemilopa ya Mwami. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Neco muntu uliyense katana ulya shinkwa nekunwina munkomeshi iyi alicencete mwine abone nawelela. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pakwinga na bantu kabalya shinkwa nekunwina mu nkomeshi cakuteshiba mubili wa Klistu nceulapandululunga, bakute kulikwila lombolosho. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi bantu bangi pakati penu balatyompwanga kayi balakolwanga nabambi bafwa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Na katulicenceta, nkatwela kwingila mulombolosho lulico sobwe. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Neco Lesa ukute kutupa cisubulo, kwambeti twiye kuba ne mano kwambeti, katutakacanika nemulandu pamo nebantu bacinka manungo pabintu byapa cishi capanshi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Neco, mobanse bame, batuloba ne batukashi, cindi ncomulabungananga pamo kulya Mulalilo wa Mwami kamupembelanga banenu. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Uliyense lanyumfunga nsala alyele limo cakulya kung'anda kwakendi kwambeti kamutaliletela cisubulo cindi ncomulabungananga pamo. Bintu nabimbi mbyondabulu kwamba ninkese nkabyambe ndakesa.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Makani a bipo bya Mushimu Uswepa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pacino cindi,li nkansuni kwambeti mubule kuba ne lwinshibo pa bipo bya Mushimu Uswepa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mucishi cena kwambeti kamutana mwinshiba Lesa mwalikuba mwataika munshila shingi, kayi mwalikupailila tumbwanga tutacikonsho kwamba. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi ndamwambilingeti kuliya muntu ukute Mushimu wa Lesa wela “kushingana Yesu.” Kayi muntu wabula Mushimu Uswepa nkela kwambeti “Yesu eMwami.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pali bipo bya Mushimu Uswepa byapusana pusana bikute kupewa kufuma ku Mushimu Uswepa umo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pali nshila shapusanapusana shakusebenselamo, nsombi ni Mwami umo wa kusebensela. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pali ncito shakusebenselamo shapusana pusana, nsombi ni Mwami umo ukute kupa ncito kubantu bonse. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mushimu Uswepa ukute kubonekela munshila yopeleyo ku muntu uliyense, kwambeti byonse bintu binyamfwenga bantu bonse. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mushimu Uswepa ukute kupa muntu cipo cakwamba mwamano, kumuntu naumbi Mushimu Uswepa ukute kumupa cipo calwinshibo nekupa mano bantu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mushimu Uswepa wopelowo ukute kupa bantu nabambi cipo cakuba ne lushomo, nabambi ukute kubapa cipo ca ngofu shakusengula. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nabambi ukute kubapa ngofu shakwinsa bishikukankamanisha, kuli nabambi ukute kubapa cipo cakushinshima. Kuli nabambi ukute kubapa lwinshibo lwa kupusanya pakati pabintu bilafumunga ku Mushimu Uswepa ne bintu bilafumunga kumbi. Kuli nabambi ukute kubapa cipo cakwamba milaka yapusana pusana yabula kwishibikwa, kayi nekupa nabambi cipo ca kusansulula iyo milaka. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mushimu Uswepa wopelowo eukute kwinsa bintu byonsebyo. Ukute kupa muntu uliyense cipo camwelela kumuyabila.</para>
  <para style="s">Mubili umo ukute bilama bingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Klistu ulyeti mubili ukute bilama bingi. Nikukabeti bilama nibingi nsombi mubili ni umo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nambi njafwe Bayuda nambi bakunsa, basha nambi babula kuba basha nsombi twense twalatambula lubatisho mu Mushimu Uswepa umo kwambeti tube mubili umo. Lesa ewalatupa twense Mushimuwo kwambeti tunwe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Cilama cimo nkacela kupanga mubili, mubili wapangwa ne bilama bingi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Na mwendo wambeti pakwinga ntame cikasa nkandipo cilama ca mubili, neco nkacela kupesheti cibule kuba lubasu lya mubili. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Na litwi lyambeti pakwinga ntame linso, neco nkandipo cilama camubili” Ico nkacela kupesheti cibule kuba cilama ca mubili, sena ngacibeco? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Na mubili wonse newalaba linso, inga muntu nakute kunyumfweconi? Nambi niwalaba litwi, inga muntu nakute kunyumfweconi lyema? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lino mbuli ncocibele, Lesa mwine ewalapanga bilama mu mubili byapusana pusana kwelana nekuyanda kwakendi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nkapela kuba mubili na bilama byonse kabili cilama cimo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Bilama ni bingi nsombi mubili ni umo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Neco linso nkalyela kwambila cikasa eti nkandikusunipo, nawo mutwi nkawela kwambila mwendo eti nkandikusunipo. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Paliya cela kwinshika na bilama nabimbi bikute kuboneketi biliya ncito bibulako kumubili. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Bilama mbyotukute kuboneti biliya ncito embyotwela kupa bulemu kupita byonse. Bilama bikute kupa nsoni embyotukute kufweka. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bilama bikute kuboneka cena nkatukute kubifweka. Lesa walapamankanya pamo bilama byamubili kwambeti bipe bulemu bulayandikinga. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Walenseco kwambeti mubili kautapansana, nsombi kwambeti cilama ciliconse cisebenselenga cinendi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Cilama cimo canyumfwa kubaba, bilama byonse bikute kunyamfwa kubaba. Cilama cimo capewa bulemu, byonse bikute kukondwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mwense njamwe mubili wa Klistu uliyense nicilama camubili uyu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lesa walabika bantu mu mubungano wa bantu ba Lesa cakutanguna walabika batumwa, kukonkapo walabika bashinshimi, pakupwililisha walabika beshikwiyisha. Walabika bantu nabambi balikuba nengofu sha kwinsa bishikukankamanisha, nabambi bakute ngofu shakusengula ne kunyamfwa nabambi, kayi nekuba batangunishi nambi kwamba milaka yabula kwishibikwa. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Bonse nkabela kuba batumwa, bonse nkabela kuba bashinshimi, bonse nkabela kuba beshikwiyisha, bonse nkabela kuba nengofu shakwinsa bintu bishikukankamanisha <verse number="30" style="v"/>nambi kusengula, kayi bonse nkabela kuba nengofu shakwamba milaka yabula kwishibikwa, nambi kuba nengofu shakusansulula bintu bilambwanga. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Amwe kamubikani myoyo yenu pabipo bilayandikinga.</para>
  <para style="p">Lino ndimulesheni nshila yaina kupita shonse.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Makani a lusuno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nambi kandicikonsha kwamba milaka ya bantu nambi mulaka ngobakute kwamba bangelo, nomba na kandi ndabula lusuno ndakoshaneti mulangu nambi ngoma ilayobekenga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nambi ndalapewa cipo ca kwamba mulumbe wa Lesa nambi ndalapewa cipo ca kwinshiba bintu byonse ne kwinshiba byasolekwa. Nambi kankute lushomo lunene lwa kwinseti nganyamuna milundu nekwitwala pamusena naumbi nakandi ndabula lusuno paliya ncombele. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nambi buboni bwakame bonse ndibuyabila bapenshi nambi nduyaba mubili wakame kwambeti bantu bautente pamulilo, nomba kandi ndabula lusuno paliya cakame cilipo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lusuno lwekalikana kayi lwaina kwine, luliya munyono, nkalukute kulilumbaisha nambi kulikonempesha sobwe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lusuno luliya minyungwe, nkaluliyanda kayi nkalukalala nambi kusunga cintu kumoyo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nkalukondwa ne bintu byabula kululama, nsombi lukute kukondwa ne cancine ncine. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lusuno lukute kulekelela byonse, lukute kupa lushomo, nkalutyompwa bwangu, lukute kupita mu makatasho alabangilingeti mulilo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lusuno nteti lukapwe,bushinshimi nibukapwe, kwamba mu milaka yabula kwishibikwa nikukapwe, nawo mano a bantu nakapwe. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kwinshiba bintu ne kukambauka kwetu nkakwesulila. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Neco cakwana cakashika ico cabula kukwana nicikapwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mpondalikuba mwana, kwamba, micito ne kuyeya kwakame kwalikubeti kwakanike. Lino mpondala kula mushimba bintu byonse bya ku butwanike ndalabileka. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Bintu mbyotulabononga cino cindi eti mucilola nkabilabonekenga cena. Nomba pacindico nitukabibone cena. Pacino cindi kwinshiba kwetu nkakwesula, nsombi pacindico nitukanyumfwishishe cena mbuli Lesa ncanjinshi cena.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pa cino cindi pali ibi bintu bitatu, lushomo, kupembelela ne lusuno. Nomba pali ibi bitatu lusuno elwapitapo.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Bipo bya bushinshimi ne milaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kamucinkani manungo mukuba ne lusuno, kayi mubike moyo pa bipo bya Mushimu Uswepa makamaka pa cipo ca kushinshima. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Abo beshikwamba mu milaka itanyumfwiki nkabakute kwamba kubantu, nsombi balo bakute kwamba ne Lesa pakwinga paliya muntu ukute kunyumfwa nambi kwinshiba ncobalambanga. Ngofu ya Mushimu Uswepa eikute kuyubulula byasolekwa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nsombi neye lambanga mulumbe wa Lesa ukute kwambila bantu eti bantu bayuminishishiwe ne kubakondwelesha. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Abo bakute kwamba mu milaka yabula kwishibikwa bakute kulinyamfwa bene, nomba balo bakute kwamba mulumbe wa Lesa bakute kunyamfwa mubungano wa bantu ba Lesa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ingankondwa kwambeti mwense ngamuba necipo cakwamba milaka yabula kwishibikwa, nomba ncondayandishishinga nicakwambeti mwense mube necipo cakwamba mulumbe wa Lesa. Pakwinga muntu lambanga mulumbe wa Lesa wapita muntu lambanga mumilaka yabula kwishibikwa pabula muntu naumbi lasansululunga ncalambanga kwambeti mubungano wa bantu ba Lesa unyamfwiwe. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nomba lino mobanse bame, nilunyamfo cini ndwenga mucana na ame ndesa uko ntatika kwamba mumilaka njomuteshi? Paliya lunyamfo ndomwela kucanapo sobwe, nsombi nandamuletele bintu ibyo Lesa mbyalayubululu nambi bishi kupa lwinshibo, Lesa mbyalampeti ndibyambe nambi ciyisho cimbi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nicimo cimo bintu byabula buyumi mbuli kankobele nambi kalumbu muntu nkalalilishinga na ubula kupusanya ndilishilo, inga lanyumfunga ngawishibeconi lwimbo lulembilwanga? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Na lalilishinga tolompita ubula kulilisha maswi eshikunyumfwika cena, niyani wela kulibambila kulwana nkondo? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ni cimo cimo ne njamwe, ni muntu cini wela kunyumfwa ncomulambanga na nkamulambanga maswi alanyumfwikinga cena, maswi enu nakengangowa mulukupwe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mwakubula kutonshanya sobwe, pali milaka ingi pacishi capanshi, nikukabeco mulaka uliwonse ukute ncolapandululunga. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Na kantawishi mulaka ngwalambanga uyo lawambanga, kwakame nimwensu kuli njame, nenjame ndemwensu kulyendiye lambanga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nomba pakwinga mulayandishishinga bipo bya Mushimu Uswepa elekeshani kubisebensesha, makamaka bipo bishi kuyuminisha mubungano.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi muntu lambanga mu mulaka wabula kwishibikwa apaile kwambeti, apewe cipo ca kusansulula mulaka ngwalambanga. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Na ndapailinga mu mulaka wabula kwishibikwa, Ee mushimu wakame ulapailinga, nomba mano akame paliya ncalenshinga. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Na ncecibeleco, inga ninyinseconi? Lino nimpaile ne kwimbila ne mano akame. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Na kamulumba Lesa ne mushimu wenu wonka, inga muntu ngomuli nendi utacishi cili mu mushimu wenu ngawambeconi eti, “Amen” Ku mupailo wenu wa kulumbaisha Lesa kakuli nkacishi ncomwambanga. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nambi mupailo wenu kuli Lesa kauli waina nomba bantu nabambi nkacela kubanyamfwa sobwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ndalumbunga Lesa pa kumpa kwinshiba kwamba milaka ingi kupita amwe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Neco, ningasalapo kwamba maswi asanu alanyumfwikinga cena kwambeti njiyishe bantu mu mubungano wa bantu ba Lesa kupita kwamba maswi angi mumulaka wabula kwishibikwa,ici ngaciba cena.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mobanse bame, kamutayeyangeti batwanike. Ee pa bintu byaipa kamubani eti batwanike batacishi caipa, nomba mukuyeya kamubani bamakulene. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mu Mabala a Lesa mwalembwa maswi alambangeti</para>
  <para style="q">“Ninkambe ku mushobo uwu</para>
  <para style="q">kupitila mu bantu beshikwamba milaka yabula kwishibikwa,</para>
  <para style="q">Kayi ne pa milomo ya bantu bensu.</para>
  <para style="q">Nikukabeco, nteti bakanyumfwile</para>
  <para style="q">ncalambanga Lesa wa Ngofu shonse.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Neco kwamba mu milaka yabula kwishibikwa bakute kukushoma ni bantu babula lushomo, ntebo bakute lushomo sobwe. Kukambauka Maswi a Lesa bakute kukushoma ni bantu bakute lushomo, ntebo babula lushomo sobwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Na bantu bonse babungana pamo mu mubungano batatika kwamba mu milaka yabula kwishibikwa, nomba bantu bensu kayi nambi bantu abo babula lushomo, sena nkabela kwambeti mulakonyo? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nomba na mwense kamushinshima muntu wabula lushomo nambi utacishi wingilamo nakanyumfwishishe maswi kayi nakamwikate nekwinshiba bwipishi bwakendi, kayi nakamubeteke maswi opelawo ngalanyumfu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mulumbe wa Lesa nukalete patuba byonse byasolekwa mu moyo wakendi, nakasuntame ne kulumbaisha Lesa ne kusuminisheti Lesa mpwali pakati penu.</para>
  <para style="s">Byonse kabinshikanga cena mu mubungano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mobanse bame, ncendapandululunga nici, mwabungananga pamo pa kupaila, muntu naumbi inga kakute lwimbo, naumbi ciyisho cakwambeti ayishe, naumbi inga kakute kantu nkalamuyubulwili Lesa. Naumbi inga kakute maswi akwamba mu mulaka wabula kwishibikwa, naumbi inga kacikonsha kupandulula maswi awo alambwanga. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kapataba bantu beshikwamba milaka yabula kwishibikwa mwabungananga pamo bapitilila pababili nambi batatu pacindi cimo sobwe. Kamupananga cindi cakwamba kayi pabe muntu lapandululunga cilambwanga. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Na paliya lapandululunga, uyo lambanga amwene tonto ambenga mwine mu moyo wakendi Lesa nanyumfwenga. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kakuba bantu babili nambi batatu abo Lesa mbwalapa mulumbe wakwamba nabambi babetekenga bintu mbyobalambanga. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nomba na uyo wekala mu mubungano latambulu mulumbe kufuma kuli Lesa uyo wambanga acileke. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mwense ninga mwamba mulumbe wa Lesa na kamwambapo umo ne umo, kwambeti mwense mwiye kayi muyuminishiwe. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kayi bipo bya kwamba mulumbe wa Lesa byelela kwendeleshewa ne bashinshimi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pakwinga Lesa nte Lesa wa minyungwe sobwe, nsombi niwa lumuno. Kwelana mbuli cilenshikinga mu mibungano ya bantu ba Lesa yonse ya bantu baswepa, <verse number="34" style="v"/>batukashi babenga bamwena mumibungano yabantu ba Lesa, pakwinga nkabelela kupewa cipuna ca ncito mu mibungano ya bantu ba Lesa, neco babenga balibombelesha cabulemu, mbuli milawo ya Mose ncoilambanga. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Na kabayanda kunyumfwishisha cena, caina kwambeti benga kwipusha balume babo kung'anda, pakwinga cikute kupa nsoni mutukashi kwambapo mumubungano. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Sena Maswi a Lesa alafumina kuli njamwe, nambi alashika kulinjamwe mwenka? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Na pali muntu layeyengeti ni mushinshimi, nambi kwambeti ukute cipo ca Mushimu Uswepa, asumine bintu ibi mbyondamulembele, pakwinga endibyo Mulawo wa Mwami. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nomba na pali muntu utasuni kushako mano, Lesa nendi nakamusule. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Neco mobanse bame, kamulangaulani mulumbe ulafumunga kuli Lesa mwabuya, kamutakanishanga abo bashoma kwambeti kabatambanga mu milaka yabula kwinshibika. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Cilayandikinga nicakwambeti bintu binshikenga munshila yelela kayi yalumbuluka.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kupunduka kwa Klistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pacino cino cindi mobanse bame, ndayandanga kumwanushako Makani Aina ngondalamukambaukila. Mwalatambula cena pakwinga epashimpa lushomo lwenu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lesa nakamupulushe ne Mulumbe Waina uwu,na kamusunga cena maswi akendi ngondalamukambaukila. Na mubula kwinseco,lushomo lwenu ingaluba lwabulyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ame ndalatambula makani alayandikinga, awo ngondalamwambila mbuli ncondalambilweti, Klistu walafwila bwipishi bwetu mbuli ncecalembwa mu Mabala a Lesa, <verse number="4" style="v"/>kwambeti balamubika mumanda, nomba Lesa walamupundusha pabusuba bwa butatu mbuli Mabala Lesa ncalambanga. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kayi palikuba makani akwambeti walabonekela kuli Petulo ne kuli batumwa likumi ne babili. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kayi walabonekela kuli beshikwiya bakendi bapita myanda isanu, bangi bacili bayumi lelo necikabeti nabambi bafwa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pacindi nacimbi walabonekela kuli Jemusi ne kuli batumwa bonse.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomba pamapwililisho walabonekela kulinjame ondyeti mwana ngobalayambakanya. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ame njame mung'ana pabatumwa bonse, kayi nkandelela nekukwiweti mutumwa sobwe, pakwinga njame ndalikupensha mubungano wa Lesa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nomba cebo ca kwambeti Lesa waina moyo, lelo nenjame ndemutumwa. Kwina moyo kwakendi ntelo kwabulyo sobwe, kayi ndalimbikila kusebensa ncito kupita batumwa nabambi, nomba ntame ndalikusebensa sobwe, nsombi ni kwinamoyo kwa Lesa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Neco ncondalikukambauka nambi ncobalikukambauka nabambi, nsombi twense tulakambaukunga Mulumbe umo umo uwo ngomulashomonga.</para>
  <para style="s">Kupunduka kwetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lino, pakwinga mulumbe wetu niwakwambeti Klistu walapunduka kubafu, inga nipacebo cini nabambi mulinjamwe ncobela kwambileti bafwa nteti bakapunduke? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pakwinga na bafwa nteti bakapunduke, ekwambeti nendi Yesu uliya kupunduka kubafu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Anu na Klistu uliya kupunduka kubafu, ncotulakambaukunga nicabulyo, kayi nekushoma kwenu nikwabulyo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pelu palico, ingacilesheti afwe tulabepenga Lesa, pakwambeti Lesa walapundusha Yesu kubafu. Na nicakubinga kwambeti bafwa nteti bakapunduke, anu Lesa uliya kumupundusha Yesu kubafu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Neco, na bafwa nteti bakapunduke, anu neye Yesu uliya kupunduka sobwe. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kayi na Lesa uliya kumupundusha Yesu, okwambeti lushomo lwenu muli Klistu nilwabulyo, kayi mucili panshi pangofu yabwipishi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kayi ngacipandululeti abo balafwa kabali bashoma muli Yesu, bafwa kufwililila. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Na kupembelela kwetu muli Klistu nikwabuyumi bwacino cindi conka, ekwambeti afwe ingatuba ne nsoni kupita bantu bonse mucishi capanshi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nomba cakubinga nicakwambeti, Lesa walamupundusha Klistu kubafu kuba citondesho cakwambeti, uliyense eti akafwe nakapundushiwe kubafu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mbuli lufu ncolwalesa pacebo ca muntu umo, cimocimo nekupunduka kubafu kwalesa pacebo ca muntu umo. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mbuli Adamu ncalatuletela lufu twense, nenjafwe twense Klistu nakatupundushe kubafu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nomba Lesa nakapundushenga muntu uliyense pacindi cakendi camwelela. Cakutanguna Lesa walapundusha Klistu cisepo citanshi, kayi Klistu akesa nakapundushe abo bashoma muliendiye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Popelapo mapwililisho acishi nakashike, Klistu akakoma bendeleshi bamishimu yaipa bonse, bulelo bonse ne ngofu shonse nakatwale Bwami mumakasa a Lesa Baishi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Neco Klistu welela kwendelesha bulelo kushikila cindi Lesa ncoti akakome balwani bakendi, ne kubabika panshi pamyendo yakendi Klistu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mulwani wakupwililisha eti akomwe ni lufu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mabala a Lesa alambangeti, “Lesa labiki bintu byonse panshi pa myendo ya Mwana muntu.” Paliya kutonshana nditu pamaswi akwambeti, “bintu byonse” Nkabilasankanyangaponga Lesa mwine uyo labikinga bintu byonse kuli Klistu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Neco bintu byonse byakabikwa mubwendeleshi bwa Klistu, nendi nakalibike panshi pa bwendeleshi bwa Baishi abo balabika bintu byonse panshi palyendiye, kufumapo Lesa nakendeleshe kwakupwililila kucindi cacindi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ingalino, cilyeconi kubantu abo balabatishiwanga pacebo ca bantu bafwa? Nicani ncobela kwinsa? Na nicakubinga kwambeti Lesa nkelela kupundusha bafwa, mbuli bantu ncobalambanga, inga nipacebo cini bantu ncobalabatishiwanga cebo cabafwa beti bakabule kupundushiwa? <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nipacebo cini afwe ncotulabikilinga buyumi bwetu mumapensho cindi conse? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mobanse bame, ame ndalangananga nelufu busuba ne busuba. Nomba ndambilishinga kulitunta kwakame palinjamwe, nikulitunta kwa buyumi bwetu muli Klistu Yesu, kayi ecilampanga kwambeco. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lino na ndalalwana ne bantu abo bela kwambweti nibanyama kuno ku Efenso, kupitila mumiyeyo ilafumunga kubantu, inga ndalacanapo cani? Neco na bafwa nteti bakapunduke, anu caina kwinsa mbuli ncobakute kwambeti.</para>
  <para style="q">“Katulyani ne kunwa.</para>
  <para style="q">Pakwinga lilo nitukafwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Kamutabepwa. Cinga cakwenda pamo ne bantu bakute bwikalo bwaipa cikute kwipisha bwikalo bwaina.” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Cangamukani! Shiyani bwikalo bwenu bwaipa. Ndambanga cakumupa nsoni pakwinga mobambi nkamumwishi Lesa.</para>
  <para style="s">Ncoti ukabe mubili pakupunduka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Naumbi muntu ngawipusheti, “Inga bafwa nibakapundukeconi? Nibakabe ne mibili ilyeconi?” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Uku nikwipusha kwakutabila! Mukute mwafumbika nseke mubulongo, nkaikute kumena kaitana ibeti ilabolo. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kayi nkamwela kubyala nseke shamena kendi, nsombi inseke shine, na ni shamaila nambi shacishango camushobo uliwonse. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lesa eukute kupa mbuto imo ne imo mubili, kwelana ne kuyanda kwakendi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Munyemfu wabintu byonse bikute buyumi nkawakoshana sobwe, bantu bakute munyemfu umbi, banyama bakute umbi, nasho inswi shikute munyemfu umbi. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Pali mibili yakwilu, kayi neya pacishi capanshi, nabo bulemu bwa mibili yakwilu bwapusana ne bulemu bwa mibili yapacishi capanshi. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Lisuba nkalyakoshana ne mwenshi, nawo mwenshi nkawakoshana ne nyenyenshi, nasho nyenyenshi nkashakoshana sobwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Umu emoti ikabele mibili pakupunduka kubafu. Mubili ngotukute kubika mumanda ukute kuya kubola, nomba wapundushiwa nteti ukabole sobwe. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Pakubika mubilli mumanda ukute koli waipa, kayi wabula ngofu, nomba pakupunduka nukabe wabeka! Ukute ngofu! <verse number="44" style="v"/>Mubili ukute kubikwa mumanda ni mubili wabuntu, pakupunduka nukabe mubili wa mushimu. Nditu na pali mubili wabuntu, anu nawo mubili wa mushimu nkoli. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Pakwinga Mabala a Lesa alambangeti, “Adamu muntu mutanshi walalengweti abe muyumi” Nomba Adamu wakupwililisha emushimu ukute kupa buyumi. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Neco, tulabono kwambeti ntewo mubili wa mushimu wela kutanguna, nsombi usa mubili wabuntu, wakonkapo ni mubili wa mushimu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Muntu wakutanguna walikuba wapacishi capanshi, kayi walabumbwa kufumina kubulongo, muntu walakonkapo walafumina kwilu kumayoba. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Mbuli muntu wakutanguna walabumbwa kufumina kubulongo ncalikuba encobabele bapacishi capanshi, mbuli uyo wakwilu kumayoba ncabele encobabele nabo bakwilu. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Lino mbuli ncotwakoshana ne uyo walabumbwa kufumina kubulongo, kayi nitukakoshane ne uyo walafuma kwilu kumayoba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Mobanse bame, cintu ncondambanga nicakwambeti, muntu ukute mubili wa munyemfu ne milopa nkela kwingila mu Bwami bwakwilu sobwe, nambi cikute kufwa, kuba citabolo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Nyumfwani cancine ncine casolekwa, nteti tukafwe twense. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Pakwinga tolompita yakalila twense nitukashinte popelapo, mbuli kukapula kwa linso. Pakwinga tolompita yakalila bafwa nibakapunduke, nteti tukafwepo kayi twense nitukashinte. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Pakwinga mibili ikute kubola yela kuba itabolo. Cikute kufwa cela kushinta kuba citafu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Ici cakenshika kwambeti, cikute kubola cakashinta kuba citabolo, kayi ceshikufwa cakashinta kuba citafu, popelapo Mabala a Lesa nakakwanilishiwe alambangeti, “Lufu lulalobo kayi kukoma kulashiki. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Obe lufu inga kukoma kwakobe kulikupeyo? Obe lufu inga ngofu shakobe shilikupeyo?” <verse number="56" style="v"/>Lufu lwalafuma kubwipishi, nabo bwipishi bwalafuma ku mulawo. <verse number="57" style="v"/>Nomba tulalumbunga Lesa latupanga ngofu shakukoma kupitila muli Mwami wetu Yesu Klistu! <verse number="58" style="v"/>Neco, mobanse bame, kamwimanani ncili. Sebensani ncito ya Mwami cindi conse, pakwinga mucisheti ncito ya Mwami njemulenshinga nteyo yabulyo sobwe.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Byakubenga bya bantu ba Lesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Lino kwamba sha makani a kubenga mali akunyamfwilisha baklistu banetu bali mu Yudeya, ndambangeti mwinse mbuli ncondalambila mibungano ya mucimpansha ca Galatiya.” <verse number="2" style="v"/>Uku okwambeti sondo ne sondo muntu uliyense abikenga pambali mali kwelana mbuli ncabele mwine pang'anda, kwambeti kakutakaba kubenga ne kubunganya mali cindi ncotinkese kwenu uko. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lino ndakashika, nkacane mwasala bantu beshi bakatwale bipo byenu ku Yelusalemu pamo ne makalata alabapandululunga. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Na cikayandika kwambeti nenjame nkenga, ninkenga pamo nabo.</para>
  <para style="s">Paulo layeyenga sha bulwendo bwakendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pakwisa uko ninkapitile ku Makedoniya pakwinga enkondayeyenga kuya kupitila. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ninkekale nenu kwa cindi citali, mpani cindi ca mupewo conse, kwambeti mukanyamfweko bintu bilayandikinga mubulwendo ndakafumanga uko ne kuya kulikonse nkoti nkayande kuya. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nkansuni kumufwakashila kwakacindi kang'ana sobwe, nsuni kwambeti na Lesa akasuminishe nkekaleko kwacindi citaliko.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kuno ku Efenso ninjikaleko mpaka cindi ca Pentekosite. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pakwinga kuno incito ilakonempe nikukabeti kuli bantu bangi bantotekenga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Na Timoti akese uko mukamutambule cena kwambeti katakanyumfwa buyowa, pakwinga neye lasebensenga incito ya Mwami iyo njondasebensenga. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kamutakaleka bantu nabambi pakati penu kumunyansha sobwe, mukamunyamfwe mubulwendo bwakendi bwakwisa kuno kulinjame mulumuno, pakwinga ndamupembelelenga kwisa kuno.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ndelekeshe tunkanda twingi kumuyuminisha mwanse wetu Apolo kwambeti amufwakashile pamo ne banse nabambi, nomba nkasuni pacino cindi, nakese akacana cindi.</para>
  <para style="s">Maswi akulayana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kamubani bantu babangamana cindi conse, bemana cituloba mu lushomo. Kamubani babula buyowa bakute lushomo lwayuma nta! <verse number="14" style="v"/>Bintu byonse mbyomulenshinga, binshikenga mulusuno.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mucishi cena kwambeti Stefano pamo neba mung'anda yakendi ebalatanguna kulesha lushomo muli Klistu cimpansha ca Akaya. Balibenga kusebensela baklistu banabo, neco ndamusengenga mobanse bame, <verse number="16" style="v"/>kamunyumfwilani batangunishi balico, ne bantu bonse balasebensenga cangofu pamo nendibo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ndakondwa kuboneti Stefano, Fotunato, ne Akayasi balesa kuno, cilabeti mwense nkomuli. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwisa kwabo kulantontosho moyo, mbuli ncobalamutontosha myoyo ne njamwe. Kamushako mano ne kubalemeka mubintu mbyobalamwambilinga bantu aba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mibungano ya bantu ba Lesa ya mucimpansha ca Asiya ilamupanga mitende. Akula ne Prisila pamo ne baklistu bakute kubungana mu ng'anda yabo balamupanga mitende mu Lina lya Mwami Yesu uyo latwikatanyanga pamo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Banse bonse kuno balamupanga mitende. Kamupanani mitende yakasala. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kamutambulani mitende njondalembenga ndemwine ame Paulo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Na pali muntu utasuni Lesa, muntuyo abe washinganwa. Ee! Kamwisani linolino Mwami. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kwina moyo kunene kwa Mwami Yesu kube nenjamwe. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lusuno lwakame lube kuli bonse bashoma Klistu Yesu.</para>
</usx>
